Note
When you change the name of materials or of ingredients at a later point in time in the MaterialsTable,
you also have to manually change this name in the text box Material of the FluidSource and of the
DePortioner, and/or the text box Product of the Mixer. Plant Simulation does not automatically do that
for you.
