If we need to run the same sequence of materials again, with a pause in between, we can program a
Method to do so. We named our Method startSecondSequence and entered this source code.
print EventController.SimTime
FluidSource.Material = void
FluidSource.Material = SequenceTable
fillTanks
To execute it during our simulation run, we entered this instruction into our init method:
&startSecondSequence.executeIn(1:00:00)
PatchMatrix.resetConnections
fillTanks
At the end of the simulation run the Tanks consequently contain twice the amount of the materials.
